"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ComponentReplaced"}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/componentreplaced","type":"topic"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Family":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family","title":"Family","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/family","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Family","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A group of entities that share a common set of component types."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Family","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A lightweight, fast and easy to use Entity-Component System in Swift."}],"title":"FirebladeECS","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs","type":"topic"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Family/forEach(reading:writing:_:)":{"title":"forEach(reading:writing:_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEach(reading:writing:_:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/family\/foreach(reading:writing:_:)","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"each C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"forEach","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"R1","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W1","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reading","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":